      "seoData": {
        "seo": {
          "relAlternateMobile": "https://www.flipkart.com/flipkart-minutes-store?marketplace=HYPERLOCAL",
          "keywords": "Flipkart Minutes Store, Flipkart Minutes Store Online Shopping",
          "noIndexSeo": false,
          "ogTitle": "Flipkart Minutes | Everything in Minutes",
          "canonical": "https://www.flipkart.com/flipkart-minutes-store?marketplace=HYPERLOCAL",
          "title": "Flipkart Minutes | Everything in Minutes",
          "content": "\n\n<h1 class=\"editorTitle1\">Shop for Instant Satisfaction with Flipkart Minutes</h1>\nElevate your shopping experience with Flipkart Minutes which caters to your daily requirements with speedy delivery. It offers unmatched convenience of quick shopping and fast delivery, aligning with today\u2019s fast-paced lifestyle. You can easily pick your everyday essentials on the Flipkart app and get them delivered to your doorstep. This feature also provides instant delivery in just minutes, ensuring you do not keep waiting for a long time. It only takes a few taps to get the fruits and vegetables that you are craving at the moment. You no longer have to go out to buy them from the market for such instant cravings. In addition, you can enjoy seamless and convenient shopping for groceries and household essentials. It makes the shopping experience effortless and stress-free. In addition, you can shop for mobiles and electronics instantly.<br />\n\u00a0\n<h2>Seamless Shopping for Groceries, Fruits, and Vegetables</h2>\nThe Flipkart Minutes offers instant satisfaction of getting your essentials delivered in minutes. This feature allows you to purchase groceries the moment you need them. You do not have to go on grocery trips or spend time on it. Simply make the grocery list and order it on the Flipkart app seamlessly. Whether you want a quick snack or beverages, you can instantly get it with a few taps on the user-friendly Flipkart app. Even when you run out of bakery products, tea, or coffee, you can effortlessly order it online for instant delivery.<br />\n<br />\nMoreover, you can shop for fruits and vegetables at the very moment you want to have them. Shop for a fresh variety without having to dress up and visit the market, ensuring you do not waste much valuable time. With this instant doorstep delivery, you can enjoy the convenience of home delivery. You no longer have to compromise your taste buds with what you have. Instead, you can order what you crave for and enjoy it at the very moment. You also have the benefit of choosing from a wide variety of options, including those that are rarely available. If you cannot find those in your local market or nearby store, you can place the order online on the Flipkart app and get them delivered instantly.<br />\n\u00a0\n<h3>Shop for Household Essentials and Personal Care at Your Fingertips</h3>\nYou can order the essential items you require in your household with the convenience of instant doorstep delivery. Whether you need cleaning supplies for the kitchen, bathroom, or laundry, the Flipkart Minutes offer an ultimate solution at your fingertips. You can also order other household essentials such as dishwashing items, trash bags, air fresheners, disposable tableware, and more.\u00a0<br />\n<br />\nIn addition, shop for your personal care items and get instant delivery. With just a few taps, you can have your cosmetics, lipsticks, bath soaps, face creams, toothpaste, perfumes, and more delivered to your doorstep. You can select the ones you require, check out more options, and make secure payments. This ensures a safe mode of transaction while having your products delivered instantly.<br />\n\u00a0\n\n",
          "googleSiteVerification": false,
          "alexaVerifyId": false,
          "headerContent": "<p>Shop easily for all your essentials and get quick delivery with the Flipkart Minutes feature. It offers the ultimate solution to convenient shopping for all your household requirements. You can stock up on fruits and vegetables with just a few taps on our user-friendly app. It also offers an easy and secure way to shop for various products, ranging from personal care and household essentials to mobiles and electronics. You can check out new gadgets in the market and get them delivered instantly. Get rid of waiting for days and enjoy your brand-new gadgets. It also allows you to purchase groceries and various household essentials instantly. This feature lets you comfortably get your grocery list in no time. Even when you need a quick snack, the feature on the Flipkart app allows you to shop for it instantly. This new Flipkart feature ensures speedy delivery in minutes at your doorstep. With its instant delivery feature, you can avoid grocery trips and last-minute arrangements. You can now experience the future of online shopping that aligns with your busy lifestyle. So, say goodbye to long queues and waiting periods to buy these essentials. Enjoy the instant satisfaction of shopping with Flipkart Minutes. This information is updated on 01-Sep-26.</p>",
          "ogUrl": "https://www.flipkart.com/flipkart-minutes-store?marketplace=HYPERLOCAL",
          "androidAppURI": "android-app://com.flipkart.android/flipkart/de_pp_seg_--_/",
          "seoFooterTitle": "More about Flipkart Minutes",
          "faqList": [
            {
              "id": 32450,
              "question": "What can I shop for on Flipkart Minutes?",
              "answer": "You can use Flipkart Minutes to shop for daily essentials."
            },
            {
              "id": 32451,
              "question": "How long does it take for stuff to be delivered via Flipkart Minutes?",
              "answer": "It takes just about 10 minutes from the time you order for things to be delivered to your home."
            },
            {
              "id": 32452,
              "question": "Can I order groceries from Flipkart Minutes?",
              "answer": "Yes, you can order groceries from Flipkart Minutes. Since it takes only 10 minutes to deliver, you can order fresh fruits and vegetables even at the last minute."
            },
            {
              "id": 32453,
              "question": "Can I order anything other than groceries on Flipkart Minutes?",
              "answer": "Absolutely!! You can order snacks, groceries, beverages, cleaning supplies, dishwashing items, trash bags, air fresheners, disposable tableware, and more on Flipkart Minutes. You can also have your cosmetics, lipsticks, bath soaps, face creams, toothpaste, perfumes, and more delivered to your doorstep. Apart from that, you can also order household essentials such as dishwashing items, trash bags, air fresheners, disposable tableware, and more."
            },
            {
              "id": 32454,
              "question": "What modes of payment are supported on Flipkart Minutes?",
              "answer": "You can pay using UPI, Cards, or Cash on Delivery. Depending on what you\u2019re comfortable with, you can pay via your preferred mode of payment. Rest assured, every transaction is safe and secure, and you can be sure that your money is safe."
            },
            {
              "id": 32455,
              "question": "Will I find the products I need on Flipkart Minutes?",
              "answer": "Flipkart Minutes allows you to buy some of the most commonly found products and have them delivered to your home in emergencies. You will also find some products which you rarely find in stores in your locality."
            },
            {
              "id": 32456,
              "question": "What if the products I order on Flipkart Minutes and it takes longer to deliver?",
              "answer": "Ideally, it will not take longer than expected for you to get the items that you have ordered. The centers are usually located as close to the delivery address as possible, ensuring swift delivery. Even if it takes longer, it is most probably due to weather or road conditions. Rest assured that Flipkart Minutes will have your necessities delivered to you as soon as possible."
            }
          ],
          "alAndroidUrl": "flipkart://fk.dl/v2/www.flipkart.com/flipkart-minutes-store?marketplace=HYPERLOCAL&autoSwitchAddress=true&originalUrl=%2Frealme-buds-wireless-5-50db-anc-360-degree-spatial-audio-ip55-38hrs-playback-bluetooth%2Fp%2Fitm98edfd0118e5a%3Fpid%3DACCH6SR8QPWRQEGB%26lid%3DLSTACCH6SR8QPWRQEGBGEBQQD%26marketplace%3DHYPERLOCAL",
